{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1210697-most-spellcaster-like-lodge-new-to-werewolf","id":1210697,"title":"Most spellcaster-like Lodge? New to Werewolf","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-23T17:35:12-07:00","id":1210697,"title":"Most spellcaster-like Lodge? New to Werewolf","content":"I'm new to Werewolf, and trying to make a character that is as spellcaster-like as possible. I looked through the Codex list and came up with a few possibilities, but since I'm new I would welcome the insight of those that have played. Here is what I have:<br /> Cult of Bones<br /> Lodge of the Modernist<br /> Lodge of the Storm's Eye<br /> Lodge of Prophecy<br /> Lodge of Seasons<br /> Lodge of Winter<br /> <br /> \u200bWhat are your thoughts?<br /> Thanks,<br /> Mal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3359-malleable","name":"Malleable","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T18:02:28-07:00","id":1210706,"title":"","content":"It may help to know what criteria you're using for &quot;spellcaster-like&quot; and also whether you're using 1e or 2e, before any advice is put forward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T20:49:20-07:00","id":1210783,"title":"","content":"The Storm's Eye would probably be most appealing to me, but I think at a certain point the only way to get 'more' spellcaster-like is to role-play it. Some can be done via mechanics, though, buying up lots of rites and having your character seek out more, as well as Gifts and other things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T10:01:01-07:00","id":1211010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1210697-most-spellcaster-like-lodge-new-to-werewolf?p=1210706#post1210706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It may help to know what criteria you're using for &quot;spellcaster-like&quot; and also whether you're using 1e or 2e, before any advice is put forward.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess its the non-physical means of attack/defense, seer/prophecy stuff, mental control, magical means of stealth, maybe throwing around lightning bolts. Using Rituals and Gifts that have an effect on the environment or others that don't necessarily buff me in a physical way. <br /> <br /> Suggestions and reason appreciated.<br /> Thanks,<br /> Mal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3359-malleable","name":"Malleable","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T10:45:45-07:00","id":1211039,"title":"","content":"Which edition though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T11:26:23-07:00","id":1211072,"title":"","content":"Forsaken 2 I guess, but I could be given flexibility for other editions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3359-malleable","name":"Malleable","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-24T13:17:50-07:00","id":1211117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malleable</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1210697-most-spellcaster-like-lodge-new-to-werewolf?p=1211010#post1211010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I guess its the non-physical means of attack/defense, seer/prophecy stuff, mental control, magical means of stealth, maybe throwing around lightning bolts. Using Rituals and Gifts that have an effect on the environment or others that don't necessarily buff me in a physical way.<br /> <br /> Suggestions and reason appreciated.<br /> Thanks,<br /> Mal</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Cahalith</b> with the Gifts of:<ul><li><b>Dominance </b>(for almost mind-control)</li> <li><b>Elements </b>(Influences in the 4 Classical Elements)</li> <li><b>Insight </b>(seer-like effects)</li> <li><b>Knowledge </b>(same)</li> <li><b>Nature </b>(for a more druidly take)</li> <li><b>Shaping </b>(transformations and object destruction)</li> <li><b>Stealth </b>(for... stealth)</li> <li><b>Technology </b>(for a more Technomancer take)</li> <li><b>Warding </b>(magical area control)</li> <li><b>Weather </b>(environmental effects)</li> </ul>Cahaliths get prophetic dreams. You might also want to invest in various Rites, but especially the Fetish Rite. With that, you can bind Spirits into all sorts of Fetishes, for &quot;magic items&quot;, and especially ones that can alter what other Gift Facets do to cover any holes you want.<br /> <br /> As for Tribe, Bone Shadows seem especially Shamanistic, and get a proprietary Rite that lets them bottle Spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}